          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni buzuba bwasika, Ncobeni bwasika, Malweza amusikila, Musamu wasyuuka. Micelo yakulisumpula yafulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 6:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luuni lwabuka, lwaba musako wabubi. Takukooyoosyaala naba omwe akati kabo, niziba imbono zyabo, nibuba buvubi bwabo. Takukooyooba kulisumpula akati kabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciindi casika. Buzuba buli afwaafwi, Sikuula atasekeleli, alakwe sikuulisya atalili, nkaambo bukali bwasikila boonse buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikuulisya takooyoopiluka kumakwebo aakwe, nekuba kuti bacili baumi, nkaambo cilengano cilaamba aamakamu aabo boonse. Bukali tabukooyoopiluka pe, nkabela takukooyooba naba umwi uuliyumya mububi bwabuumi bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
