        },
        {
          "text": "Bayoosowa insiliva yabo mumigwagwa, ayalo ingolida yabo iyooba mbuli cintu cisofweede, Ingolida yabo ansiliva yabo zyoonse zilakacilwa kubavuna mubuzuba bwabukali bwa-Jehova. Tazikonzyi kubakutya nikuba kuzuzya mada aabo, pe, nkaambo nzenzizyo zyaba cilebyo cakubawisya muzibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
